            "review_title": "Review at La Baguette",
            "review_text": "Bac P\nHạ Long Bay, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nHighly recommend\nOct 2026 • Solo\nJust tried the new Vietnamese menu at La Baguette in InterContinental Hạ Long. The dishes shine with fresh local ingredients like squid, black tiger prawns, and grouper – expertly prepared and full of authentic flavors. The setting is elegant, and the service was professional yet genuinely warm and attentive. A truly memorable dining experience. Highly recommend and can’t wait to return!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nBook ahead. Park on Level 2, then ask reception for a buggy to La Baguette. Spacious for big family gatherings.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 2, 2026",
