            "review_title": "Review at La Baguette",
            "review_text": "Josh\n12 contributions\n0\nSo Delicious\nDec 2025 • Family\nThis restaurant is inside the brand new intercontinental hotel in Ha Long Bay, which is itself amazing and I highly recommend. As for the restaurant, everything was top notch, from service to staff to atmosphere. We ordered the surf and turf tower that includes an amuse bouche, scallop crudo, a morel, foie gras consomme to start. The tower itself included a whole lobster, whole grouper, tooth fish, lamb chops, filet mignon, duck breast, oysters, lots of roasted vegetables, myriad of sauces both French and Vietnamese and more. It was amazing and so generous. We were full so quickly as there was a lot of amazing food. The food was an expression of the variety of regions of Vietnam, mountains, rivers, oceans as well as the different cuisines that have influenced this country, namely French. As I said we were full very quickly but the staff was gracious enough to pack it all up for us so we could enjoy it later in our room. You should definitely check this place out if you are in the area. My compliments to the chefs for their great skills and the rest of the staff for their attention and care. We felt like family here. Thank you.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 14, 2025\nChi N\nXin chao Navigate29250348130,\n\nThank you very much for your exceptionally detailed and heartfelt review.\n\nWe are truly honored by your generous words and delighted to know that your experience with us was so memorable. It is wonderful to hear that you enjoyed not only the ambiance of the InterContinental Halong Bay Resort, but also every aspect of your dining experience - from the attentive service to the carefully curated atmosphere.\n\nYour appreciation of the Surf & Turf Tower means a great deal to our culinary team. Your thoughtful observations beautifully captured the essence of what we strive to deliver. We are also grateful for your kind remarks about our team’s attentiveness and care. Ensuring that our guests feel welcomed and well looked after - even arranging to package your meal for later enjoyment is part of our commitment to providing a truly personalized experience. Knowing that you felt “like family” is the highest compliment we could receive.\n\nPlease accept our sincere thanks for your recommendation and encouragement. We very much look forward to welcoming you back for another exceptional culinary experience in the near future.\n\nSincerely,\nJesper Bach Larsen\n\nGeneral Manager\nInterContinental Halong Bay Resort\nRead more\nWritten February 12, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
