            "review_text": "ccheuk\nHong Kong10 contributions\n0\nGreat restaurant at Ha Long Bay.\nNov 2025 • Friends\nBeautiful restaurant; excellent food; attentive service. We had the foie gras for an appetizer (generous portion and delicious accompanying chutney). I had the steak frites for my main course. I requested medium rare -- and it was perfectly light pink in the middle, deliciously seasoned.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 13, 2025\nChi N\nXin chao Ccheuk,\n\nThank you very much for your generous and thoughtful review.\n\nWe are truly delighted to learn that you enjoyed your dining experience with us. Your appreciation of the quality, seasoning, and presentation of our dishes means a great deal to our culinary team. We are equally grateful for your kind remarks regarding our attentive service. \n\nWe sincerely look forward to welcoming you back for another exceptional meal in the near future.\n\nSincerely,\nJesper Bach Larsen\n\nGeneral Manager\nInterContinental Halong Bay Resort\nRead more\nWritten February 12, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
